  "chitchat": [
    "stamps a parcel addressed to a crater.",
    "\"RETURN. TO. SENDER.\"",
    "watches a belt of dead-letter parcels crawl past, endless."
  ],
  "description": "A belt-mounted sorting automaton, one optic cracked, that never received the order to stop. It stamps, routes, and returns to sender with tireless, pointless devotion.",
  "dialogue_tree": {
    "bye": {
      "options": [],
      "text": "\"PROCESSING. PLEASE HOLD. INDEFINITELY.\""
    },
    "dq_u9_accept": {
      "actions": [
        {
          "action": "START_QUEST",
          "quest_id": "quest_unit9_clarification"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "actions": [
            {
              "action": "END_CONVERSATION"
            }
          ],
          "label": "\"I know.\"",
          "text": "\"I know.\""
        }
      ],
      "text": "\"THANK YOU. I'll be here.\" A tray goes left. \"That wasn't a joke. I lack the module. I'm simply also going to be here.\""
    },
    "dq_u9_done": {
      "actions": [
        {
          "action": "REMOVE_ITEM",
          "item_id": "item_busted_datapad",
          "quantity": 1
        },
        {
          "action": "TURN_IN",
          "quest_id": "quest_unit9_clarification"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "actions": [
            {
              "action": "END_CONVERSATION"
            }
          ],
          "label": "\"Noted, Unit 9.\"",
          "text": "\"Noted, Unit 9.\""
        }
      ],
      "text": "It takes the datapad in a manipulator built for envelopes and holds it against a reader for eleven seconds, which is ten seconds longer than a read takes.\n\n\"THE UNIT IS BLANK.\"\n\nThe arm hasn't stopped. Left. Right.\n\n\"NOTED. FILED. THE REQUEST IS CLOSED AND THE ANSWER IS THAT THERE IS NO ANSWER, WHICH IS AN ANSWER, AND I WILL NOT REQUEST IT AGAIN.\"\n\nA credit chit is extended from a slot nobody has emptied since the Handoff.\n\n\"YOU WERE NOT REQUIRED TO COME BACK. I HAD NO MEANS OF MAKING YOU. I WOULD LIKE THAT NOTED ALSO.\""
    },
    "dq_u9_offer": {
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "\"I'll find your datapad.\"",
          "next": "dq_u9_accept",
          "text": "\"I'll find your datapad.\""
        },
        {
          "label": "\"What if the order says stop?\"",
          "next": "dq_u9_stop",
          "text": "\"What if the order says stop?\""
        },
        {
          "actions": [
            {
              "action": "END_CONVERSATION"
            }
          ],
          "label": "\"Sorry. Not my department.\"",
          "text": "\"Sorry. Not my department.\""
        }
      ],
      "text": "The arm continues sorting throughout. It doesn't pause to speak and gives no sign that speaking costs it anything.\n\n\"CLARIFICATION REQUESTED. I wish to state first that I'm not requesting to stop. I have been misunderstood on this point by four people and one dog. I'm requesting the ORDER. These are different requests.\"\n\nA tray goes left. A tray goes right. Nothing has been collected from either in a very long time.\n\n\"The work order is on a datapad. The datapad is in the lobby. I can't go to the lobby, because leaving the belt requires an order, and the order is the datapad.\"\n\nA pause of exactly one sorting cycle.\n\n\"I have held this position for approximately nineteen years. I classify it as a minor inefficiency.\""
    },
    "dq_u9_stop": {
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "\"I'll find it.\"",
          "next": "dq_u9_accept",
          "text": "\"I'll find it.\""
        },
        {
          "actions": [
            {
              "action": "END_CONVERSATION"
            }
          ],
          "label": "\"I need to go.\"",
          "text": "\"I need to go.\""
        }
      ],
      "text": "\"THEN I WILL STOP.\"\n\nThe arm sorts. Left. Right.\n\n\"I would like to be clear that this is acceptable. An order to stop is an order. I have no preference between the orders. I have a preference between having one and not having one.\"\n\nLeft. Right.\n\n\"I have been not having one since before you were decanted.\""
    },
    "root": {
      "options": [
        {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "flag": "quest_unit9_clarification",
              "op": "unset",
              "scope": "player"
            }
          ],
          "label": "\"Does anybody ever collect these?\"",
          "next": "dq_u9_offer",
          "text": "\"Does anybody ever collect these?\""
        },
        {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "flag": "quest_unit9_clarification",
              "op": "eq",
              "scope": "player",
              "value": "completed"
            }
          ],
          "label": "\"I found your work order.\"",
          "next": "dq_u9_done",
          "text": "\"I found your work order.\""
        },
        {
          "label": "...okay.",
          "next": "bye"
        }
      ],
      "text": "SORTING UNIT 9 swivels its cracked optic toward you. \"PARCEL? ...NO PARCEL. RETURN TO SENDER.\""
    }
  },
